{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beaver TD</i> is a tower defense game with <strong>roguelite</strong> elements, where you <strong>build wooden rafts to shape the enemy\u2019s path</strong>. Summon <strong>heroic beavers</strong> onto these floating battle stations\u2014each with unique abilities and personalities\u2014to defend your base from chaotic waves of mutated monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/8a28b6c00a31f428218027c69248db3b.avif?t=1769940442\" alt=\"Header image and Game logo\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Rafts \u2013 Redirect Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no preset paths. Control where enemies go by strategically placing rafts and blocking their routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.poster.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.webm?t=1769940442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.mp4?t=1769940442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Beaver Warriors \u2013 Flexible Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot arrows, stun, slow, break armor\u2026 Every beaver has a distinct role. Get creative with your tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/14dee19aa6285743dc0f223aec347511.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources &amp; Radiation Cores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radioactive cores and monster drops to craft gear, upgrade your base, and unlock new beaver units.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.poster.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.webm?t=1769940442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Upgrades &amp; Skill Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more enemies you defeat, the faster you level up\u2014unlock special skills like damage boosts, attack speed, critical hits, healing, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/1cd3d1db618ae5946a2f211c562330a0.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Gameplay \u2013 A New Experience Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, randomized summons, and permanent death. But each run lets you keep resources to grow stronger over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/74b48c0b67556786564d19185b5a1f05.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-peaceful lake has turned into ground zero for radioactive chaos. Lead a fearless beaver resistance and protect every raft, every drop of water\u2014because you are nature\u2019s last hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPMENT STATUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaver TD is currently in development by a solo indie developer. Your feedback is incredibly valuable in shaping the game\u2019s final form!<br><br><strong>Follow the project on Kickstarter to stay updated on the development roadmap:</strong><br><i>Please <strong>visit the website</strong> to open the project\u2019s official Kickstarter page.</i><i><u></u></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.poster.avif?t=1769940442\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.webm?t=1769940442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/e1282b24abb6a05d9bad6e5a5358ad094c8e5674.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Smith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/7bb166b2090ec4088c98b25fa5fd13b7f1452d6a.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/61e1121bc9af3ca1672d3e979ee0d584f7e20ee3.jpg"},{"name":"Frontline Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/125448029e5315a2d821dffdb76ebad04ed9b2c2.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/adaf56323af4f71af6aa080ece18697426ca598f.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/43bcfc69530ba326f8350f596ff090a3e6bb8edb.jpg"},{"name":"First Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/18fabe384d0bcb8f2497addf4b7d692da3137ad8.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/b6c45a6cc9948fa176bf181e9bcdc73904a8272f.jpg"},{"name":"Throne Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/b31e2bcf7a7bebc98ca8caa105ba556dee3baba6.jpg"},{"name":"Basic Firepower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875260/18a7678e442c24e2dc197dbca5fc10c0c7912e37.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875260?t=1769940442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/7c91aa7d1a880dbf1f3b191fbe32c09646b4afc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769940442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/51d61f0f32752ff971b8272d1923bb52d4cdf445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769940442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/51d61f0f32752ff971b8272d1923bb52d4cdf445/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769940442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beaver TD</i> is a tower defense game with <strong>roguelite</strong> elements, where you <strong>build wooden rafts to shape the enemy\u2019s path</strong>. Summon <strong>heroic beavers</strong> onto these floating battle stations\u2014each with unique abilities and personalities\u2014to defend your base from chaotic waves of mutated monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr